{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a thrilling platformer adventure where danger lurks around every corner. Each level is packed with cunning traps, moving platforms, and hidden hazards designed to test your timing and precision. To progress, players must carefully navigate through spikes, pits, and shifting obstacles while keeping their focus on collecting every coin scattered across the stage. Reflexes and strategy are equally important, as missing a single coin means the level cannot be completed. With increasing difficulty, unique trap patterns, and rewarding challenges, this game pushes you to master movement and decision-making. Only the most skilled players who balance agility and awareness will conquer all stages and claim ultimate victory.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3949030?t=1759514919","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3949030?t=1759514919","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949030/710fdf36b9822e9cf48e5229ead8965017dfa4a6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759514919","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949030/710fdf36b9822e9cf48e5229ead8965017dfa4a6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759514919","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a thrilling platformer adventure where danger lurks around every corner. Each level is packed with cunning traps, moving platforms, and hidden hazards designed to test your timing and precision. To progress, players must carefully navigate through spikes, pits, and shifting obstacles while keeping their focus on collecting every coin scattered across the stage. Reflexes and strategy are equally important, as missing a single coin means the level cannot be complet